<link rel="icon" href="https://ap-south-1.linodeobjects.com/arnatech/2023/11/cropped-DALL·E-2023-11-29-12.39.45-A-simplified-and-modern-logo-for-a-technology-company-named-Arna-Tech.-The-logo-should-be-minimalist-and-sleek-focusing-on-a-simple-yet-impactful-d-e1701246668329-192x192.png" sizes="192x192" />
